### Frontend guidelines (React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui)

- **Entry**: [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/main.tsx](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/main.tsx) and [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/App.tsx)
- **UI components**: Prefer shadcn/ui primitives in `components/components/ui/*` and helpers in [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/lib/ui.ts](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/lib/ui.ts)
- **API base**: Default `http://localhost:8080`. For builds, set `VITE_API_BASE` (see [Dockerfile.frontend](mdc:Dockerfile.frontend)).
- **WebSocket**: Subscribe to `/ws/jobs/{jobId}` for live job updates.
- **Type safety**: Avoid `any`. Define request/response types for API calls. Keep React 18 idioms.
- **Styling**: Use Tailwind classes; prefer `cn` helper where present. Keep dark-mode compatibility (see `ThemeToggle`).
- **State**: Co-locate component state; lift only when needed. Prefer composition over large monoliths.
- **Build & scripts**: See [cat-video-creator/frontend/package.json](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/package.json). `npm run dev|build|preview`.